doc:
Callback for instrument detail loading operations

This trait allows native code (iOS/Android) to receive loading completion notifications.

# Parameters
- `is_success`: Whether the loading operation succeeded

# iOS/Android Usage

```kotlin
// Kotlin implementation
class LoadListener : LoaderCallback {
override fun onLoadComplete(isSuccess: Boolean) {
if (isSuccess) {
println("Instrument loaded successfully")
} else {
println("Failed to load instrument")
}
}
}

swapFacade.loadBizInfoDetail("BTC-USDT-SWAP", LoadListener())
```

```swift
// Swift implementation
class LoadListener: LoaderCallback {
func onLoadComplete(isSuccess: Bool) {
if isSuccess {
print("Instrument loaded successfully")
} else {
print("Failed to load instrument")
}
}
}

swapFacade.loadBizInfoDetail(instId: "BTC-USDT-SWAP", loader: LoadListener())
```
